            <title>[IGNITE-17660] Add missing opens/exports to java15+ configuration</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17660</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;`add opens/exports java.lang.invoke` should be added to the parent/pom.xml so that Java17 compilation would work correctly along with surefire tests.&lt;/p&gt;

